# Quiet paws: out on your windows your pet acts out its job with poses only. The setting (general
# page, "out on your windows": off | big things | everything) only changes what's drawn. The pet
# plays on a pretend desktop inside the game window (desk on), never on the real one.
from pile_full
paws everything              # the profile keeps its settings between runs
view full
tab settings
wait 1
expect text "out on your windows"
expect setting paws 2
expect fits
shot settings
click "big things"
expect setting paws 1
shot big
click "everything"
expect setting paws 2
expect fits
teach boxes
task boxes
give-box starter 30
desk on
wait 1.5                      # it drops in and lands on the window
wait packing 0.05
shot desk_reach
wait packing 0.4
shot desk_boxes
wait packing 0.7
shot desk_shake
wait packing 0.02
shot desk_hop
desk good
wait 1
shot desk_hold
wait 4
teach machine
task machine
wait 1
crank 1
shot desk_crank
send garden 1
finish-trips
wait 1
shot desk_wait
paws off
wait 2
shot desk_off
desk off
tab settings
expect setting paws 0
expect fits
